<div id="modal-backdrop" class="modal-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<!-- Privacy Policy Modal -->
<div id="modal-privacy" class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-privacy-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-start justify-between">
      <h2 id="modal-privacy-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Privacy Policy</h2>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" data-modal-close aria-label="Close privacy policy">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2l14 14M16 2L2 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer-text space-y-4" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem;">
      <p>LendPath ("we," "us," or "our") is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Information We Collect:</strong> We collect information you provide directly (name, address, email, phone, financial information) and information collected automatically (IP address, browser type, usage data).</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">How We Use Your Information:</strong> To match you with lenders, process your loan inquiry, communicate with you about your inquiry, comply with legal obligations, and improve our services.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Sharing Your Information:</strong> We share your information with lenders in our network for the purpose of fulfilling your loan request. We may share data with service providers who assist our operations. We do not sell your personal information to unauthorized third parties.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Your Rights:</strong> Depending on your state of residence, you may have rights under CCPA, VCDPA, or other state privacy laws to access, delete, or opt out of the sale of your personal information.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Contact:</strong> For privacy inquiries, contact us at privacy@lendpath.com.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Terms of Service Modal -->
<div id="modal-terms" class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-terms-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-start justify-between">
      <h2 id="modal-terms-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service</h2>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" data-modal-close aria-label="Close terms of service">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2l14 14M16 2L2 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer-text space-y-4" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem;">
      <p>By using LendPath, you agree to these Terms of Service. Please read them carefully.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Not a Lender:</strong> LendPath is a loan marketplace. We are not a lender, broker, or agent for any lender. We connect you with potential lenders but do not guarantee you will receive a loan.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">No Guarantee:</strong> Checking your rate does not guarantee approval. Loan decisions are made solely by individual lenders based on their criteria.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Accuracy of Information:</strong> You agree to provide accurate and complete information. Providing false information may be a violation of federal and/or state law.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">TCPA Consent:</strong> By submitting a loan inquiry, you consent to be contacted by LendPath and its lender partners by phone, email, or text message, including automated calls and texts, regarding your inquiry.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Governing Law:</strong> These terms are governed by applicable law.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Disclosures Modal -->
<div id="modal-disclosures" class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-disclosures-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-start justify-between">
      <h2 id="modal-disclosures-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Rate &amp; Loan Disclosures</h2>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" data-modal-close aria-label="Close disclosures">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2l14 14M16 2L2 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer-text space-y-4" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem;">
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">APR Disclosure:</strong> Annual Percentage Rates (APRs) on loans offered through our network range from 5.90% to 34.99%. Repayment terms range from 6 to 72 months. Your actual APR depends on your credit score, income, debt obligations, loan amount, and term.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Example Loan:</strong> A $5,000 loan at 18.00% APR for 36 months results in a monthly payment of approximately $180.76 and a total repayment of approximately $6,507.36. This is an example only.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">State Availability:</strong> Not all lenders operate in all states. Availability of loan products varies by state and lender.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Credit Impact:</strong> Submitting a pre-qualification request typically results in a soft credit inquiry that does not affect your credit score. However, if you accept a loan offer, the lender will perform a hard credit inquiry which may affect your credit score.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Licensing:</strong> LendPath operates as a marketing and lead generation platform. Individual lenders in our network are independently licensed and regulated.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ADA Accessibility Modal -->
<div id="modal-ada" class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-ada-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-start justify-between">
      <h2 id="modal-ada-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">ADA Accessibility Statement</h2>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" data-modal-close aria-label="Close accessibility statement">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2l14 14M16 2L2 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer-text space-y-4" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem;">
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Our Commitment</strong></p>
      <p>LendPath is committed to ensuring digital accessibility for people with disabilities. We continually improve the user experience for everyone and apply relevant accessibility standards in accordance with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and WCAG 2.1 Level AA.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Feedback &amp; Contact</strong></p>
      <p>If you experience any difficulty accessing content on our website, please contact us: accessibility@lendpath.com &nbsp;|&nbsp; 1-800-555-0123</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- Data Safety Modal -->
<div id="modal-datasafety" class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-datasafety-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-box">
    <div class="mb-5 flex items-start justify-between">
      <h2 id="modal-datasafety-title" class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Data Safety</h2>
      <button class="modal-close-btn" data-modal-close aria-label="Close data safety information">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M2 2l14 14M16 2L2 16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="disclaimer-text space-y-4" style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.8rem;">
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">How We Protect Your Data</strong></p>
      <p>All data transmitted between your browser and our servers is encrypted using 256-bit SSL/TLS encryption. Data stored in our systems is encrypted at rest.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">How Your Data Is Used</strong></p>
      <p>Your information is used solely to match you with lenders in our network. We do not sell your personally identifiable information to unauthorized third parties.</p>
      <p><strong class="text-slate-300">Your Rights</strong></p>
      <p>Depending on your state, you may have rights under CCPA, VCDPA, CPA, or other state privacy laws. To exercise your rights, contact privacy@lendpath.com.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .modal-backdrop {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 8999;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }
  .modal-backdrop.open {
    display: block;
  }

  .modal-panel {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9000;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .modal-panel.open {
    display: flex;
  }

  .modal-box {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 38rem;
    max-height: 85vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: #1c2030;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    animation: modalIn 0.2s ease forwards;
  }

  @keyframes modalIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .modal-close-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: 1rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: #94a3b8;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s, color 0.15s;
  }
  .modal-close-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    color: #fff;
  }
</style>

<script>
  function openModal(id: string) {
    const panel = document.getElementById(id);
    const backdrop = document.getElementById('modal-backdrop');
    if (!panel || !backdrop) return;
    backdrop.classList.add('open');
    panel.classList.add('open');
    panel.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'false');
    document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
  }

  function closeAll() {
    document.querySelectorAll('.modal-panel.open').forEach((el) => {
      el.classList.remove('open');
      el.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
    });
    document.getElementById('modal-backdrop')?.classList.remove('open');
    document.body.style.overflow = '';
  }

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal]').forEach((trigger) => {
      trigger.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const id = (trigger as HTMLElement).dataset.modal!;
        openModal(id);
      });
    });

    document.querySelectorAll('[data-modal-close]').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', closeAll);
    });

    document.getElementById('modal-backdrop')?.addEventListener('click', closeAll);

    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (e.key === 'Escape') closeAll();
    });
  });
</script>
